 "title": "Rome, 22 April 1428: the third cipher run of the letter",
 "caption": "The 160 signs of run 3 of Pandolfo Malatesta's letter (DECODE R1854 image 1), in Tomokiyo's labels as corrected by Prizmic, decoded here with his key. The two null signs (v, g) show as dots; the scribe writes c for co in comitem. The key was built together with this reading, so the decode checks the transcription and the key, not the cipher.",
